SUMMARY:Anaheim Ballet's Nutcracker
LOCATION:DigAlert Grove of Anaheim\, Anaheim
DESCRIPTION:The holiday season comes to life in the 40th season of Anaheim 
 
Ballets Nutcracker\, the heartwarming tale of Clara and her Nutcracker Doll
 
 who changes her woeful winter into a fanciful feast in Candyland. The Nutc
 
racker ballet is a cornerstone of seasonal family entertainment and traditi
 
on. Anaheim Ballets full-length Nutcracker is the production you and your f
 
amily must see\, a story presented with heart as only AB can present it\, m
 
ore than dance... Anaheim Ballet Nutcracker performances feature staging an
 
d choreography by Sarma Lapenieks Rosenberg\, Anaheim Ballets acclaimed Art
 
istic Director. Anaheim Ballet\, founded by Directors Lawrence Rosenberg an
 
d Sarma Lapenieks Rosenberg\, has been a premiere Southern California arts 
 
organization for over forty years and is the resident ballet company of the
 
 City of Anaheim. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/anaheim-ball
 
ets-nutcracker-anaheim-california-11-28-2026/event/09006524D54AEA95
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/anaheim-ballets-nutcracker-anaheim-califor
 
nia-11-28-2026/event/09006524D54AEA95
